        <mxCell id="v1" value="&lt;b&gt;SSD-A3: Select neighbourhood and request community membership&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Document:&lt;/b&gt; behaviour design, iteration 2, DA-12 (Student 3), v1.0 draft&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FRs realised:&lt;/b&gt; FR-A-06, FR-A-07, FR-A-08, FR-A-09, NFR-PR-01.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rationale:&lt;/b&gt; The member sees only coarse outcomes. One GPS fix and the invitation code are checked inside the system and discarded, so no coordinate ever appears in a reply, a log or a stored row (A11, D13). Every uncertain outcome still creates a request for a moderator; nothing is rejected automatically." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F7F9FC;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1D1D1D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
