        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="v1" value="&lt;b&gt;SSD-D1: Submit a review after a completed loan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Document:&lt;/b&gt; behaviour design, iteration 2, DA-12 (Student 3), v1.0 draft&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;FRs realised:&lt;/b&gt; FR-T-09, FR-B-15, NFR-U-01.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rationale:&lt;/b&gt; Only the two parties to a COMPLETED loan may review, once each, inside a short edit window. Suspected retaliation and near-identical text are flagged inside the system and handled by the manipulation checks (D19); the reviewer is not told, so nobody is accused, and reviews never enter the trust estimate, which uses verified loan outcomes only." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#F7F9FC;strokeColor=#9AA5B1;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1D1D1D;" vertex="1" parent="1">
